⚙️ Setting Up Your Own geminicli

If you are building this CLI from scratch, I highly recommend using Node.js or Python with the official @google/generative-ai SDK (or google-generativeai in Python). You will need:
• A Gemini API Key from Google AI Studio.
• The File API (for uploading files larger than a few megabytes before prompting, which is standard for video and audio).

Are you currently using an existing community geminicli package, or are you planning to build your own custom CLI script to connect to the Gemini API?
